yle="text-align: left;"><span style="color: red"><strong>~jsims:</strong></span> <span style="color: pink"><strong><em>cklint</em></strong></span>: Dumping?</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: pink"><strong>cklint:</strong></span> We need to fully fuse SCP-████ and SCP-5949 together, or things won't work exactly as planned.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><span style="color: red"><strong>~jsims:</strong></span> Ah.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: pink"><strong>cklint:</strong></span> One sec. This tech is all a little new, so I'll need a few minutes to get things right.</td> </tr> <tr> <th></th> </tr> <tr> <td><tt><em>$SYSTEM has promoted cklint to Operator (@).</em></tt></td> </tr> <tr> <td><tt><em>Project change detected. Current page has been temporarily suspended.</em></tt></td> </tr> <tr> <td><tt><em>System: Saving current logs&#8230;</em></tt></td> </tr> <tr> <td><tt><em>Project change detected.</em></tt></td> </tr> <tr> <th></th> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: blue"><strong>asparks:</strong></span> Daniel, what are you doing?</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: cyan"><strong>ptalbert:</strong></span> &#8230;?</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: brown"><strong>drasclif:</strong></span> leave me alone.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: blue"><strong>asparks:</strong></span> Daniel you're deepthroating a sub right in front of me.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: green"><strong>jstevenson:</strong></span> O_O</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: brown"><strong>drasclif:</strong></span> this is slander.</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: blue"><strong>asparks:</strong></span> Why are you staring so intently at me?</td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: red"><strong>~jsims:</s