&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #e5ddb7; background:#fffdf0; padding:20px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: left; font-family: &amp;quot;Courier Prime&amp;quot;, monospace;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;image-container aligncenter&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5158/harimao.png&quot; width=&quot;150px&quot; alt=&quot;harimao.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;SONDHEIM AUTO-GENERATED LOG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TCKR&lt;/strong&gt; - 08102005C5R12T22:41.03L99:99.99 │ &lt;strong&gt;RV SONDHEIM&lt;/strong&gt; │ Harimao Corp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CREW:&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;[ALDMN]&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;[DARCY]&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;[KSHNA]&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;[PJEET]&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;[THERO]&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;───&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
► &lt;strong&gt;RECORDING STARTED&lt;/strong&gt; ◄&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;───&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;dialog&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[ALDMN]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Radio and logs are up and running, Mrs. Kushana.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[KSHNA]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Good. We have no time to lose.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[DARCY]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Dive successful; headed down at a speed of 10 knots.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[PJEET]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Hull pressure&#039;s looking pretty optimal.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[DARCY]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Can I ask a question, ma&#039;am? Why&#039;d we have to take on this dive so soon? The sun&#039;s gone, which is going to make Thero&#039;s job harder. We could&#039;ve waited until morning.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[KSHNA]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The stop has already put us back considerably. Other rigs are still running; this is the most densely packed area in the Pacific for oil.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
